// ====================================================================================
// MODULE: Anti-Joins (Subqueries in the WHERE Clause)
// FILE: GetAccountsWithNoWonDeals.soql
//
// PROBLEM STATEMENT & BUSINESS VALUE:
// The Sales Development leadership team is executing a pipeline reclamation strategy 
// targeting stagnated or un-monetised corporate accounts. To prevent sales disruption, 
// they need a clean list of existing business accounts that have never reached finality 
// on a successful revenue event.
//
// Cross-referencing tables manually creates severe performance overhead and data noise. 
// This query applies an efficient database-level Anti-Join (`NOT IN`) to isolate and 
// extract Account records that possess absolutely zero historical footprint inside the 
// high-value 'Closed Won' opportunity pipeline.
// ====================================================================================

SELECT Id, Name 
FROM Account 
WHERE Id NOT IN (SELECT AccountId FROM Opportunity WHERE StageName = 'Closed Won')
